{
  "title": "The Islamic greeting – salam",
  "pages": "18",
  "intro": "Salam is the greeting of peace that Muslims give each other.",
  "learn": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "img/salam.webp",
      "alt": "Two men shaking hands and greeting each other",
      "small": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<b>Salam</b> is the greeting Muslims give each other."
    },
    {
      "type": "phrase",
      "label": "The salam",
      "ar": "السَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ",
      "tr": "As-salaamu ‘alaykum",
      "en": "Peace be upon you."
    },
    {
      "type": "phrase",
      "label": "The answer",
      "ar": "وَعَلَيْكُمُ السَّلَامُ",
      "tr": "Wa ‘alaykumus-salaam",
      "en": "And upon you be peace."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "html": "When we give salam, it is lovely to add:"
    },
    {
      "type": "phrase",
      "label": "Add",
      "ar": "وَرَحْمَةُ اللَّهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ",
      "tr": "Wa rahmatullaahi wa barakaatuhu",
      "en": "…and Allah’s mercy and His blessings."
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "title": "☮️ Salam is a greeting of peace",
      "html": "It means: <b>May Allah’s peace and blessing be upon you!</b>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "We give salam:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "👨‍👩‍👧 to our parents, relatives, friends and Muslims we know,",
        "🏠 when we come into and leave the house,",
        "👥 when we arrive and when we leave a group of people."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice": [
